 "effective_n": {
  "limit": "DEFF belongs to the score-differential series and this panel\nhas no scores, so it is computed on the OUTCOME. A score differential carries the forecaster's\nown error too, so its correlations should be no larger -- the outcome-based DEFF is an UPPER\nbound and the n_eff published here is a FLOOR.",
  "source": "src/engine/grid/power_arithmetic.py (session B); functions called, never copied",
  "reconciliation_with_B": {
   "B_panel": {
    "n_dyads": 966,
